---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
---
<ServiceLayout title="Work Injury" description="Chiropractic treatment for work-related injuries at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH." schemaType="MedicalCondition">
<p>Work injuries — whether from heavy lifting, repetitive motions, prolonged sitting, or accidents on the job — can cause significant pain and limit your ability to work and enjoy life. Chiropractic care is an effective, non-invasive approach to treating many common work injuries.</p>
<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />
<h2>Common work-related injuries we treat</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:var(--sp-5); margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);">
<li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Lower back strain from lifting</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Neck and shoulder tension from desk work</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Repetitive strain injuries</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Slip and fall injuries</li>
</ul>
<h2>Getting back to work</h2>
<p>Our goal is to help you recover fully and return to work as safely and quickly as possible. We provide thorough documentation for workers' compensation cases and work closely with you throughout your recovery.</p>
</ServiceLayout>
